@BudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5045

GET {{BudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new expense
POST {{BudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Groceries",
  "amount": 450.50,
  "category": "Food",
  "date": "2026-10-22T10:00:00Z",
  "userId": "test-user-123"
}

### Get all expenses
GET {{BudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Accept: application/json